    "prompt": "TASK & FORMAT\nCreate a photorealistic 9:16 automotive POV video based on \n@video1\n. Preserve the original duration, camera choreography, action timing and continuous-shot structure.\n\nREFERENCES\n@video1\n = MOTION AND SCENE REFERENCE ONLY.\nUse this video exclusively for the original action sequence, camera movements, POV perspective, drifting choreography, hand gestures, visible legs, timing, environment and relative distances.\nDo not copy any visual design details of the original vehicle.\n\n\n@image1\n = REPLACEMENT VEHICLE IDENTITY.\nReplace the original vehicle completely with the exact vehicle shown in \n@image1\n.\nPreserve its actual brand, model, body type, proportions, paint color, headlights, grille, bumpers, wheels, windows, roofline and all distinctive exterior details.\nDo not transfer the reference image's background, camera angle or lighting.\n\nACTION\nRecreate the complete driving and drifting sequence from \n@video1\n.\nThe replacement vehicle performs the same movements as the original car, following the same trajectories and timing.\nPreserve the first-person camera perspective, extended legs and shoes in the foreground, visible hand gestures, rapid distance changes, aggressive sideways drifting, countersteering, tire smoke and close vehicle passes.\n\nCAMERA\nMatch \n@video1\n precisely: continuous wide-angle POV footage, natural handheld vibration, dynamic camera roll, rapid forward and backward relative movement, realistic parallax and motion blur.\n\nFULL VEHICLE REPLACEMENT\nPerform a 100% complete vehicle replacement.\nThe final vehicle must look exactly like \n@image1\n from every visible angle.\nDo not retain any parts, shapes, lighting elements, reflections, roof details, silhouette fragments or accessories from the original vehicle in \n@video1\n.\n\nIMPORTANT REMOVAL\nRemove any blinking, flashing or glowing yellow light on the roof.\nRemove any amber roof light, warning beacon, roof-mounted signal light or inherited roof artifact from the original vehicle.\nThe replacement car must not contain any foreign roof lights or leftover visual remnants unless such elements are clearly present on \n@image1\n.\nThe roof area must fully match the vehicle in \n@image1\n.\n\nVEHICLE IDENTITY LOCK\nThe vehicle from \n@image1\n must remain visually identical throughout the entire video, regardless of camera distance, angle, drift motion or motion blur.\nAll body panels, lights, wheels, glass shapes and roof geometry must retain the reference design consistently in every frame.\n\nPHYSICS\nRealistic tire grip, wheel rotation, steering corrections, suspension movement, vehicle inertia and smoke originating from spinning tires.\nMaintain believable drift dynamics and stable vehicle proportions.\n\nAUDIO\nRealistic engine revs synchronized with acceleration, short tire squeals during drifting and natural tire scrub sounds during direction changes.\nClean, distinct sounds with natural decay.\nNo artificial bubbling or gurgling.\nNo added music or dialogue.\n\nCONSTRAINTS\nNo remnants of the original vehicle.\nNo yellow roof light.\nNo amber beacon.\nNo leftover roof flashing.\nNo vehicle morphing or identity changes.\nNo invented car modifications.\nNo extra vehicles.\nNo unnecessary cuts.\nNo subtitles or watermarks.\nNo CGI appearance.\n\nFINAL RESULT\nThe exact vehicle from \n@image1\n performs the complete action sequence from \n@video1\n, preserving the original camera choreography and timing, with a fully clean replacement and zero visual artifacts from the source vehicle."
